a8-9b0a-02bc64695179" :question/math-academy-id "q-130083" :question/problem "Given that $D=\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x},$ what is $D(y)$ for $y={e}^{-2x}+x?$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a second-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={a}_{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{a}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{a}_{0}y\n$$\n\nwith constant coefficients  ${a}_{2}=1,{a}_{1}=2,$ and ${a}_{0}=0.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D({e}^{-2x}+x) \\\\  & =(\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x})({e}^{-2x}+x) \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}({e}^{-2x}+x)+2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{-2x}+x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2{e}^{-2x}+1)+2(-2{e}^{-2x}+1) \\\\  & =4{e}^{-2x}-4{e}^{-2x}+2 \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130083/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ec3823db-6df8-502a-a050-b5aa169d2e9d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130083"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-91043/selection/9af0824d8c16d33c120605bcbce6f8821ab35a597303d3e9e446434b8ae54d26" :answer/id #uuid "96fe6fce-1c12-543a-9682-168f0ecfab99" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91043/selection/02ab30ad02efb32631a88f62a46f036ea08b02b137f5bd196844b372d7e27773" :answer/id #uuid "3be93ea2-7f60-58d7-b17e-8968f5f00057" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91043/selection/688f8fd61cc7840ad58987615bd1ad5981f69f4f085ff3af6f66e59132bdfec0" :answer/id #uuid "779efa50-a695-57f7-a2da-9fafde3faa7d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91043/selection/644a95185e4fa98b0c4b691793cf7e546da9ff8c15073019f87b02c1a2ba2b4b" :answer/id #uuid "3a50cf21-6df8-591c-a557-db030465e7f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91043/selection/548999f3aa0f7b1a95927b21244b5236f348f5302ac9c7c83129ab5fbc19c20f" :answer/id #uuid "767f4861-3e1b-585f-897d-8c2cdb047926" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91043/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ba3ed9f6-456d-5756-8dca-e46f64cf17c9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-91043/selection/02ab30ad02efb32631a88f62a46f036ea08b02b137f5bd196844b372d7e27773" :answer-field/choices ["q-91043/selection/9af0824d8c16d33c120605bcbce6f8821ab35a597303d3e9e446434b8ae54d26" "q-91043/selection/02ab30ad02efb32631a88f62a46f036ea08b02b137f5bd196844b372d7e27773" "q-91043/selection/688f8fd61cc7840ad58987615bd1ad5981f69f4f085ff3af6f66e59132bdfec0" "q-91043/selection/644a95185e4fa98b0c4b691793cf7e546da9ff8c15073019f87b02c1a2ba2b4b" "q-91043/selection/548999f3aa0f7b1a95927b21244b5236f348f5302ac9c7c83129ab5fbc19c20f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-91043" :question/id #uuid "4a50f529-7a80-5ccf-9921-0fe6086a3323" :question/math-academy-id "q-91043" :question/problem "Given that $D=\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}-3\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x},$ what is $D(y)$ for $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x?$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a third-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={a}_{3}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+{a}_{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{a}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{a}_{0}y\n$$\n\nwith constant coefficients  ${a}_{3}=1,{a}_{2}=-3,{a}_{1}=4,$ and ${a}_{0}=0.$ \n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =(\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}-3\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x})(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-3\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)+4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)+4(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-3(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)+4\\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+4\\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-91043/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ec3823db-6df8-502a-a050-b5aa169d2e9d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-91043"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-337830/selection/a996b740fdbebe67402f84fa269e8e6ccbfc607d49bf5bf2428aeb6ad4dea4e7" :answer/id #uuid "e1a4f880-51c1-57f4-b32e-0af488492101" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-8{e}^{2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337830/selection/a85a23fe2729c2ac4e1d720ee33e03bb774a1d408d4d056822a347d6e53a2434" :answer/id #uuid "d5dd7583-7f36-546f-bc64-1f944e9f2905" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8{e}^{2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337830/selection/ae402efcc4a74a8091598f3010873663f293aaf72744db93c07f1de06d42cc1f" :answer/id #uuid "4f7a37a7-e31c-50b4-aac1-e2f253eade87" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10{e}^{2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337830/selection/c8298041f49733ab55c46a44b3ae13e32dd53306782be064d678efacce977bbc" :answer/id #uuid "ae1eaf7e-2e18-52