-solution "The given operator is a third-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={a}_{3}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+{a}_{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{a}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{a}_{0}y\n$$\n\nwith constant coefficients ${a}_{3}=1,{a}_{2}=4,{a}_{1}=4,$ and ${a}_{0}=0.$ \n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D({e}^{-2x}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+4\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}){e}^{-2x} \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}({e}^{-2x})+4\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}({e}^{-2x})+4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{-2x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(-2{e}^{-2x})+4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2{e}^{-2x})+4\\cdot (-2{e}^{-2x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{e}^{-2x})+4\\cdot 4{e}^{-2x}-8{e}^{-2x} \\\\  & =-8{e}^{-2x}+16{e}^{-2x}-8{e}^{-2x} \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-65055/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ec3823db-6df8-502a-a050-b5aa169d2e9d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65055"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-337837/selection/73b993cc88394f1bb7ecd3220d38a919ee645c559412bce55c38fdd7eb7db578" :answer/id #uuid "73178055-870e-502e-888d-e2f13ab0fdde" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337837/selection/99f9647b6c152b0dcf4c2e833a58b0fbcb8b29836adb99e90f93b3138d9e983c" :answer/id #uuid "50ae2fbe-eb3e-5e98-a101-37d4e25a01a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337837/selection/192c6030d8816553cdfcf13c7f5f26bd0bc0f29788b453b1e64332880bc35044" :answer/id #uuid "fc09c034-6527-5638-a075-cde3368e77c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337837/selection/e97fc99fb9e360c4fdb7ff6084bf70fc1e2bd640566bf7c0028693bb5b4b7aad" :answer/id #uuid "6a9132b9-dea5-5c6f-b163-6817fa33980c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337837/selection/7fd451652c1229218c7165685b1303bd91d3a4f36dfee9e490bddb3c242f81db" :answer/id #uuid "a6a5e378-8f3e-59db-b873-a2286eb0901a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{x}-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337837/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a2533ffd-a752-5f4c-8c5e-efda36b89540" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-337837/selection/99f9647b6c152b0dcf4c2e833a58b0fbcb8b29836adb99e90f93b3138d9e983c" :answer-field/choices ["q-337837/selection/73b993cc88394f1bb7ecd3220d38a919ee645c559412bce55c38fdd7eb7db578" "q-337837/selection/99f9647b6c152b0dcf4c2e833a58b0fbcb8b29836adb99e90f93b3138d9e983c" "q-337837/selection/192c6030d8816553cdfcf13c7f5f26bd0bc0f29788b453b1e64332880bc35044" "q-337837/selection/e97fc99fb9e360c4fdb7ff6084bf70fc1e2bd640566bf7c0028693bb5b4b7aad" "q-337837/selection/7fd451652c1229218c7165685b1303bd91d3a4f36dfee9e490bddb3c242f81db"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-337837" :question/id #uuid "4e7cce31-e437-5488-a28b-54343e727c5b" :question/math-academy-id "q-337837" :question/problem "Given that $D=2x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}-2,$ what is $D(y)$ for $y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x?$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a second-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{2}(x)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{2}=2x,{f}_{1}=3,$ and ${f}_{0}=-2.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) \\\\  & =(2x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}-2)\\operatorname{ln}⁡x \\\\  & =2x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)+3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)-2\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡x \\\\  & =2x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{x})+\\frac{3}{x}-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x \\\\  & =2x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}})+\\frac{3}{x}-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{x}+\\frac{3}{x}-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{x}-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-337837/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7ff7f935-dcec-5b4c-ba1d-e0b4c9e197a4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-337837"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-91035/selection/a31df842c390e5807963c0386014a20fda6f16013b69065f93f5518b8417b6df" :answer/id #uuid "d8c5b620-6b8b-5844-b4dd-4679430b1239" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2-\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91035/selection/412793739940b973be2b527fb17aec02d6ca6345201ec8cd477bb75bb5283b50" :answer/id #uuid "18a4d3bd-1165-53ef-868b-88d45dace9fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91035/selection/037a048676abd7fd5b41002fa52dcb6bd314db0b4d0a4ab5f49cab32dc84174c" :answer/id #uuid "c7c7374b-430e-556c-baae-1268d123bdf6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4-x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91035/selection/b306ad6a3af7dc043f4c3e03da26a15440a9e9b19389783b2e1203bad6e37573" :answer/id #uuid "11c4833c-96aa-5bcc-afc1-f53a43cd3ef4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91035/selection/c92a5ced6c9622c01e21ae7e08fb0538ea56aab9fb51b31b9940d156de39ef32" :answer/id #uuid "7b6cb180-fc97-577f-bb3c-3b21b07591b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91035/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "dbb18c8f-ab80-5b73-a097-538a33eda7d9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-91035/selection/b306ad6a3af7dc043f4c3e03da26a15440a9e9b19389783b2e1203bad6e37573" :answer-field/choices ["q-91035/selection/a31df842c390e5807963c0386014a20fda6f16013b69065f93f5518b8417b6df" "q-91035/selection/412793739940b973be2b527fb17aec02d6ca6345201ec8cd477bb75bb5283b50" "q-91035/selection/037a048676abd7fd5b41002fa52dcb6bd314db0b4d0a4ab5f49cab32dc84174c" "q-91035/selection/b306ad6a3af7dc043f4c3e03da26a15440a9e9b19389783b2e1203bad6e37573" "q-91035/selection/c92a5ced6c9622c01e21ae7e08fb0538ea56aab9fb51b31b9940d156de39ef32"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-91035" :question/id #uuid "bf6fe938-eeca-5659-860f-4454a76fa5a6" :question/math-academy-id "q-91035" :question/problem "Given that $D={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x},$ what is $D(y)$ for $y=2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+x?$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a second-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{2}(x)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{2}={x}^{2},{f}_{1}=x,$ and ${f}_{0}=0.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+x) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x})(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+x) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+x)+x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+x) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{2}{x}+1)+x(\\frac{2}{x}+1) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}(-\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}})+x(\\frac{2}{x}+1) \\\\  & =-2+2+x \\\\  & =x\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/an